      "value": "My argument for orange is as follows: I have friend A, I get on really well with them. I also have friend B, I also get on well with them. I know (either from past interactions or inference) that A and B will not get on well in any sense of the idea and in fact hate each other. If I can be freely joined then there's a good chance they will meet and have a bad time. I now feel responsible for that shit social interaction they've both had.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
