      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat is just as much of a social platform as any other and people are obviously allowed to experience it however they wish. Orange status is great (amongst various other reasons) for those who wish to not be constantly tracked and followed, comparable to the 'Invisible' status on Discord in some ways. I have my reasons for using it at all times with a few exceptions and I make sure to update the message of my status to indicate whether I am busy or otherwise.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
