      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You guys have big trouble understanding boundaries, jesus.\nIf someone wants to be on orange to not be stalked 24/7 then let them be. If you don't want to go through the \"hassle\" of requesting an invite because that's too time consuming or too annoying, I don't know dude, just remove them from your friends list if that's such an inconvenience.\nYou all have been complaining about this since the day the orange status got added, while for people like me this status is an absolute blessing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
